> > That makes a lot of sense! Follow up question, though: I'm still seeing something similar when I set stage = 3 (that's making the animal an adult, right?), except this time the first hour time step starts on the surface and then immediately drops to the the soilnode depth for the subsequent hours. What am I doing wrong there, if I'd like the animal to be an adult starting out?
